{"id":"2aa923dca170bacd","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-diagonalization.md","title":"Diagonalization Lemma","display":"lem-diagonalization — Diagonalization Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-diagonalization","aliases":["88-lem-diagonalization"],"display":"lem-diagonalization — Diagonalization Lemma","depends_on":["[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","[[88-df-formula]]","[[./88-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[88-df-sentence]]","[[88-df-numeral]]","[[88-df-provable]]","[[88-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]","[[88-df-representable-function]]","[[88-df-substitution]]","[[88-df-classical-calculus]]","[[88-lem-numeral-functional-representation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-diagonalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-diagonalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-diagonalization — Diagonalization Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"111244cddc854123\" href=\"?note=111244cddc854123\" title=\"./88-df-peano-arithmetic\">88-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"268c5641ccf6ec59\" href=\"?note=268c5641ccf6ec59\" title=\"88-df-diagonal-lemma\">88-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b9c2b3bb904b3813\" href=\"?note=b9c2b3bb904b3813\" title=\"88-df-representable-function\">88-df-representable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" href=\"?note=f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" title=\"88-lem-numeral-functional-representation\">88-lem-numeral-functional-representation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory containing PA, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"111244cddc854123\" href=\"?note=111244cddc854123\" title=\"./88-df-peano-arithmetic\">88-df-peano-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano arithmetic axiom set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,g\">\\(R,g\\)</span> (fixed proof calculus and Gödel coding)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\)</span> (proof-rule predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\)</span> (Gödel-numbering predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,x\">\\(\\phi,x\\)</span> (candidate formula and variable, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x}\">\\(\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x}\\)</span> (diagonal substitution function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,R}\">\\(\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,R}\\)</span> (representable-function predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{S}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{S}(R)\\)</span> 的公理与规则包含条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a>；仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffRule}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffRule}\\)</span> 并不提供这些逻辑规则。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对角代入所需的逐输入唯一输出表示来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" href=\"?note=f5c5e5f1b0bfe9f6\" title=\"88-lem-numeral-functional-representation\">88-lem-numeral-functional-representation</a>，不把图关系可表示自动当作理论内函数唯一性。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}diagonalization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{free}_S(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,R}(\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x})\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash_R\\left(\n\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/x]\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}diagonalization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{free}_S(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{RepFn}_{T,R}(\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x})\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash_R\\left(\n\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\overline{g(\\psi)}/x]\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner\\)</span> : Gödel编码 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi(x)\">\\(\\phi(x)\\)</span> : 带自由变量公式 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li>编码数必须先转成对象语言中的数词，再作无捕获代入。</li>\n<li>对角化引理：每个一自由变量公式都有一个句子固定点。</li>\n<li>Gödel不完备性定理的核心工具</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-g